%description:
Tests pushSegmentsOnWriteBoundary with TCP Fast Open. The tester deletes the SYN
of connection 2, which carries the cookie and 984 of 2000 bytes. After the
handshake, the retransmission of the SYN data has PSH, also in the middle of the
write, because Linux tcp_send_syn_data() gives that data PSH. The segment that
ends the write has PSH too.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.fastOpen=true
*.cli_app.tOpen2=0.5s
*.cli_app.active2=true
*.cli_app.localPort2=1001
*.cli_app.tSend2=0.5s
*.cli_app.sendBytes2=2000B
*.cli_app.fastOpen2=true
*.srv_app.tOpen2=0.5s
*.srv_app.localPort2=2000

*.tcptester.script="a3 delete"
*.cli_tcp.fastopenClientEnabled = true
*.srv_tcp.fastopenServerEnabled = true
*.cli_tcp.pushSegmentsOnWriteBoundary = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.501 A003] A.1001 > B.2000: S 125000:125984(984) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize NOP NOP FastOpen(cookieLen=8)# deleting
[3.501 A004] A.1001 > B.2000: S 125000:125000(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[3.503 B002] A.1001 < B.2000: A S 875500:875500(0) ack 125001 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[3.505 A005] A.1001 > B.2000: A P 125001:125985(984) ack 875501 win 16384 
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
[3.707 B003] A.1001 < B.2000: A ack 125985 win 16384 
[3.709 A006] A.1001 > B.2000: A P 125985:127001(1016) ack 875501 win 16384 
[3.911 B004] A.1001 < B.2000: A ack 127001 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
